      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even recognize myself anymore. like everything i was... everything that made me \"me\"... it just died when my hip gave out. now i'm just sitting here in this body that doesn't do anything. it's just a shell. it feels like the person i actually was is already gone and this is just the empty aftermath.",
