    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small moments of meaning... i dont know. it just feels exhausting. like i'm being told to enjoy the view from a graveyard. the \"me\" that mattered is dead, and this version is just a ghost waiting for something to happen. it feels so much more honest to just admit that the story is over and there's nothing left to write. does it ever feel like some things are just meant to reach a final chapter?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
